  "description": "Uniconta Connector for DynamicWeb 10.\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tSeamlessly integrate Uniconta ERP with DynamicWeb 10. \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tThis connector synchronizes: products, stock, prices, customers and orders, eliminating manual entry and ensuring consistent data.\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tWhile designed for DynamicWeb 10.x, support for DW 9.1x.x is also available—please contact Flex Media for details.\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tRequires Uniconta API access and an active Flex Media license.\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tIncludes documentation and setup guide.\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tMore info:\n\t\t\thttps://www.flex-media.dk/erp-integration/dynamicweb-uniconta-integration\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tSupport:\n\t\t\tEmail: support@flexmedia.dk\n\t\t\tPhone: +45 4817 6666 / +45 4422 8430",
